e-controls-touch-input-heat-map%402x.png","line":30,"embedded":true},{"title":"Playing haptics","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/playing-haptics","line":36},{"title":"A right hand holding an iPhone in landscape orientation. The thumb is pressing down on a virtual button, and the button indicates its press state by increasing its opacity and showing a glow effect around it.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/7e633e5b94444a3590ce03fee0d5c3df/game-controls-press-state%402x.png","line":38,"embedded":true},{"title":"A game controller button with a graphic of a square mapping to a virtual button with a graphic of a hand making a gesture to pick up an object.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/d5ba7d4086cc786b24b789e29bfd3507/game-controls-button-to-action%402x.png","line":42,"embedded":true},{"title":"A graphic that shows gameplay with a virtual control to move the character that's more visible while the character is moving.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/2c9a0444ff10b37e8e5b54a9036d482e/game-controls-thumbstick-in-motion%402x.png","line":51,"embedded":true},{"title":"A graphic that shows gameplay with a virtual control to move the character that's less visible while the character is at rest.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/8feb4b819cccdf9a74fa7c3ccd5d6e42/game-controls-thumbstick-at-rest%402x.png","line":55,"embedded":true},{"title":"A graphic of a virtual button that supports both single tap and touch and hold gestures.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/a92df74768951a55f0f4d406eedb6b4a/game-controls-power-up-action%402x.png","line":61,"embedded":true},{"title":"A graphic that shows placement for movement controls on the left side of the screen, and placement for camera controls on the right side of the screen.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/7bc00774e35dd1839091df6f8c16a830/game-controls-camera-thumbstick-zones%402x.png","line":65,"embedded":true},{"title":"Physical controllers","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/game-controls#Physical-controllers","line":67},{"title":"Adding touch controls to games that support game controllers in iOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/GameController/adding-touch-controls-to-games-that-support-game-controllers-in-ios","line":69},{"title":"`GCRequiresControllerUserInteraction`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/BundleResources/Information-Property-List/GCRequiresControllerUserInteraction","line":71},{"title":"Game Controller","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/GameController","line":73},{"title":"An illustration of a game controller with callouts that indicate the locations of the controller’s triggers, shoulder buttons, directional pad, and thumbsticks.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/40b70c72921efd92b91da0453533baaa/game-controls-controller-anatomy%402x.png","line":75,"embedded":true},{"title":"`GCControllerElement`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/GameController/GCControllerElement","line":77},{"title":"SF Symbols","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/sf-symbols","line":98},{"title":"A screenshot of the SF Symbols app showing symbols in the Gaming category.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/c76627e659aa17ab46a638437cc5d33c/game-controls-sf-symbols-gaming-category%402x.png","line":100,"embedded":true},{"title":"Keyboards","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/game-controls#Keyboards","line":102},{"title":"Platform considerations","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/game-controls#Platform-considerations","line":114},{"title":"visionOS","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/game-controls#visionOS